OL,3,GNEWSAHope for 'productive day' as
OL,4,Abudget talks continue
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Secretary of State Sir Chris Bryant
OL,7,Fis hosting further talks with Executive
OL,8,Fparties at Hillsborough Castle in a bid
OL,9,Fto break Stormont's budget deadlock.
OL,11,FDelegations from Sinn Fein and the
OL,12,FDemocratic Unionist Party (DUP) arrived
OL,13,Fseparately with Sinn Fein President
OL,14,FMary Lou McDonald saying she hoped it
OL,15,Fwould be a "productive day".
OL,17,FSeven months into this financial year
OL,18,Fthe Northern Ireland Executive has
OL,19,Fstill not agreed a budget.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
